{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Velora Player 是一款為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的離線影音播放器，可直接播放儲存在裝置內的音樂與影片，內置等化器、字幕支援、畫中畫及媒體庫管理，適合習慣把影音收藏放在本機、偏好離線播放的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線影音播放與字幕支援</h2>\n<p>音訊方面支援 MP3、FLAC、WAV、AAC 與 ALAC 等格式，並內置等化器、低音增強、播放速度及睡眠計時器。影片支援 MP4、MKV、AVI、MOV 與 HEVC，可播放 Full HD 及 4K 畫質，提供硬件加速、畫中畫、浮動視窗與 SRT、ASS、VTT 字幕。媒體庫可按專輯、歌手、資料夾與播放清單整理，配合最愛與即時搜尋，並支援淺色與深色模式，所有內容均可離線播放。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-198-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-199-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-200-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-201-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-202-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-203-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Velora Player: Video &amp; Audio</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T05:38:06.195479+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":399,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T05:28:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:57:40.692770+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"43b15983b97de63d636b92051b937661fb733070996b5d91d374cb1b5bb7b492","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}